sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as Application/Authorization API
    participant DB as Credential Store
    C->>API: Login
    API->>DB: Verify account/password
    API-->>C: Short-lived access token + refresh credential
    C->>API: Request resource with access token
    API->>API: Validate signature/claims/policy
    API-->>C: Protected response
    C->>API: Refresh credential (only refresh endpoint)
    API->>DB: Validate active credential/session
    API->>DB: Atomically rotate/revoke old credential
    API-->>C: New access token + replacement refresh credential
